 1882      +        30   -< 40  = 'Medium'
 1883      +        40   -< 50  = 'High'
 1884      +        50   - high  = 'Very High';
 NOTE: Format DTI_RISK is already on the library WORK.FORMATS.
 NOTE: Format DTI_RISK has been output.
 1885      +
 1886      +    /* Delinquency Risk Categories */
 1887      +    value delinq_risk
